(581037, 60568, 16266, '<td valign="top">fairly interesting, and great idea (there are a couple of shots like this which are really strong).. i think this picture lacks some actual black tone.  Or perhaps the sweater on the right, is too flat and close to middle grey.  It may work better if it was true black, or darker at least.</td>', 'fairly interesting, and great idea (there are a couple of shots like this which are really strong).. i think this picture lacks some actual black tone.  Or perhaps the sweater on the right, is too flat and close to middle grey.  It may work better if it was true black, or darker at least.', '2004-02-16 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(581040, 60153, 8842, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Focus seems to be slightly off however.  Also, the bottom portion of the frame does seem to be every so slightly underlit or underexposed.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Focus seems to be slightly off however.  Also, the bottom portion of the frame does seem to be every so slightly underlit or underexposed.', '2004-02-16 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
