(581043, 60672, 13136, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. I thought black ice was on the road in a shadow. This is more a ''Blue'' shot than ''Black''. At least the silhouettes are mostly black.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. I thought black ice was on the road in a shadow. This is more a ''Blue'' shot than ''Black''. At least the silhouettes are mostly black.', '2004-02-16 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
