(581074, 60182, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see you did not desaturate out the red on the face. The totally white background looks like it was cleaned up, like it''s missing clouds or something. Nice crisp shot.</td>', 'I''m glad to see you did not desaturate out the red on the face. The totally white background looks like it was cleaned up, like it''s missing clouds or something. Nice crisp shot.', '2004-02-16 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(581077, 60392, 16266, '<td valign="top">very humorous and creative.  i like this image a lot.  They seem like a herd of people or cattle, all trying to get somewhere... all following U. everyone was scared to go.. then U decided to go.. then EVERYONE wanted to go... depth of field works very well, framing is good and tones are great... top notch.</td>', 'very humorous and creative.  i like this image a lot.  They seem like a herd of people or cattle, all trying to get somewhere... all following U. everyone was scared to go.. then U decided to go.. then EVERYONE wanted to go... depth of field works very well, framing is good and tones are great... top notch.', '2004-02-16 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
