(581344, 60543, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and the negative space that surrounds her is integral to the image - my preference would be to crop a cm from the top and add it to the bottom so that her head is further up in the frame and her feet, even if in deepest black shadow, aren''t so close to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'This is beautiful and the negative space that surrounds her is integral to the image - my preference would be to crop a cm from the top and add it to the bottom so that her head is further up in the frame and her feet, even if in deepest black shadow, aren''t so close to the edge of the frame.', '2004-02-16 05:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(581345, 60606, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this! I wonder whether it would be more striking if the shirt where white, and perhaps a white handkerchief in the pocket? The main subject would still be black...?? I appreciate that may not have been the look you were after, I''m just thinking aloud in terms of what I might prefer in an image.</td>', 'I like this! I wonder whether it would be more striking if the shirt where white, and perhaps a white handkerchief in the pocket? The main subject would still be black...?? I appreciate that may not have been the look you were after, I''m just thinking aloud in terms of what I might prefer in an image.', '2004-02-16 05:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(581346, 60159, 3087, '<td valign="top">WOW! <br/>This is incredible, and as I sat up from my slouched position I suddenly saw more, much more. I really hope voters have their monitors well calibrated to see the details of this very subtle image.<br/>On my screen the colour tone seems just a touch greeny but not overpoweringly so.<br/>A beautiful and slightly haunting image.</td>', 'WOW! This is incredible, and as I sat up from my slouched position I suddenly saw more, much more. I really hope voters have their monitors well calibrated to see the details of this very subtle image.On my screen the colour tone seems just a touch greeny but not overpoweringly so.A beautiful and slightly haunting image.', '2004-02-16 05:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
