(581554, 60390, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the composition seems a bit awkward to me though, might be nice to see a bit more arm and have the lump of coal more away from the center with less neg space to the left.</td>', 'Nice image, the composition seems a bit awkward to me though, might be nice to see a bit more arm and have the lump of coal more away from the center with less neg space to the left.', '2004-02-16 09:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
