(581798, 60577, 4100, '<td valign="top">I would have marked this higher if it had been plain black and white without the blue eyes. The major interest comes from the composition and form of the fans (assuming they are fans) and the colour seems to compete with that for attention rather than enhancing it. Also it makes it less of a "black" shot.</td>', 'I would have marked this higher if it had been plain black and white without the blue eyes. The major interest comes from the composition and form of the fans (assuming they are fans) and the colour seems to compete with that for attention rather than enhancing it. Also it makes it less of a "black" shot.', '2004-02-16 11:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(581801, 60696, 5391, '<td valign="top">The focus could stand to be sharper on this, and the more I look, I have trouble telling what I''m looking at.  I''m guessing that the blackest parts are actually chocolate and those are nuts in the chocolate.  The pink part in the center really draws the eye wanting to be the subject but doesn''t seem to be related to the photo in any way.</td>', 'The focus could stand to be sharper on this, and the more I look, I have trouble telling what I''m looking at.  I''m guessing that the blackest parts are actually chocolate and those are nuts in the chocolate.  The pink part in the center really draws the eye wanting to be the subject but doesn''t seem to be related to the photo in any way.', '2004-02-16 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(581809, 60570, 5391, '<td valign="top">Composition is good - love the placement of the green olive, and it fits the challenge well, but the focus needs to be sharper to really make this "pop".</td>', 'Composition is good - love the placement of the green olive, and it fits the challenge well, but the focus needs to be sharper to really make this "pop".', '2004-02-16 11:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
