(581999, 60606, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I do have a couple of white spots on the left lapel showing up on my monitor.  They should have been tacked away or clonned out.  I, myself, often wear this "Regis" combination black on black and get many compliments.  May you fair just as well!  It also makes me mad that I didn''t think of it!  BOL.  BTW, just a matter of taste. . . since you have many angles in the cut of the cloth (both jacket and shirt) I felt that a Windsor knot would have been more appropriate!</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I do have a couple of white spots on the left lapel showing up on my monitor.  They should have been tacked away or clonned out.  I, myself, often wear this "Regis" combination black on black and get many compliments.  May you fair just as well!  It also makes me mad that I didn''t think of it!  BOL.  BTW, just a matter of taste. . . since you have many angles in the cut of the cloth (both jacket and shirt) I felt that a Windsor knot would have been more appropriate!', '2004-02-16 14:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
