(582043, 60577, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Those eyes got me!!!  Simple but very effective. Please tell me, if not contacts how you got the blue in her eyes so blue.  I won''t believe you if you tell me they are natural!   Also, I have another  question regarding technique:  I realize I was drawn to the eyes. . . but was it the blue or the shallow depth of field that led me there?  Why not a sharper focus (and deeper blackness) on the fans?  Best of luck.</td>', 'Ok.  Those eyes got me!!!  Simple but very effective. Please tell me, if not contacts how you got the blue in her eyes so blue.  I won''t believe you if you tell me they are natural!   Also, I have another  question regarding technique:  I realize I was drawn to the eyes. . . but was it the blue or the shallow depth of field that led me there?  Why not a sharper focus (and deeper blackness) on the fans?  Best of luck.', '2004-02-16 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
