(582156, 60570, 14453, '<td valign="top">You should have took the black olibes in oil... You would have get a deep and shiny black.  In converting your picture in gray scales like you did you lost some of the richness of the tones...  My opinion!!</td>', 'You should have took the black olibes in oil... You would have get a deep and shiny black.  In converting your picture in gray scales like you did you lost some of the richness of the tones...  My opinion!!', '2004-02-16 17:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(582158, 60155, 14620, '<td valign="top">very cute idea!  Nicely composed.</td>', 'very cute idea!  Nicely composed.', '2004-02-16 17:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(582160, 60200, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so incredibly creepy.  I''m quite sure it will give me nightmares! :)  Cool idea for the challenge.</td>', 'This is so incredibly creepy.  I''m quite sure it will give me nightmares! :)  Cool idea for the challenge.', '2004-02-16 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(582182, 60573, 806, '<td valign="top">surrounded by limbs ... the only way out, is up.<br/>decent subject matter. If I use my imagination, I can almost feel lost/turned around/etc.<br/>nice detail all the way to the small branches.</td>', 'surrounded by limbs ... the only way out, is up.decent subject matter. If I use my imagination, I can almost feel lost/turned around/etc.nice detail all the way to the small branches.', '2004-02-16 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(582188, 60341, 806, '<td valign="top">LOL. I hate to admit, that I did this with one of my cameras at Disney World! Fortunately not the most important shots!<br/>Would love to see this at a disorienting angle to give the feeling of chaos/forgetfulness/hurrying to get the shot.</td>', 'LOL. I hate to admit, that I did this with one of my cameras at Disney World! Fortunately not the most important shots!Would love to see this at a disorienting angle to give the feeling of chaos/forgetfulness/hurrying to get the shot.', '2004-02-16 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(582194, 60624, 806, '<td valign="top">great black on black. I like how it fades into the background. nice arrangement.. just flows. subject matter? okay. fairly interesting to view.</td>', 'great black on black. I like how it fades into the background. nice arrangement.. just flows. subject matter? okay. fairly interesting to view.', '2004-02-16 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(582197, 60543, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good nude study. Good use of negative space. One small thing, it seems the subject should be the black in the shot. This is good enough that it still gets high marks.</td>', 'Good nude study. Good use of negative space. One small thing, it seems the subject should be the black in the shot. This is good enough that it still gets high marks.', '2004-02-16 17:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(582198, 60301, 806, '<td valign="top">great graphic for an advertisement. really like the angle and texture.<br/></td>', 'great graphic for an advertisement. really like the angle and texture.', '2004-02-16 17:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(582200, 60525, 13136, '<td valign="top">Composition needs a bit of work. Just looks like things thrown together, not very natural.</td>', 'Composition needs a bit of work. Just looks like things thrown together, not very natural.', '2004-02-16 17:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(582201, 60531, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Good composition, lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Good composition, lighting and DOF.', '2004-02-16 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(582203, 60212, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Good choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice composition. Good choice of subject.', '2004-02-16 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(582206, 60094, 13136, '<td valign="top">Strange sculpture. Not sure the water drops work here. Good use of the white negative space.</td>', 'Strange sculpture. Not sure the water drops work here. Good use of the white negative space.', '2004-02-16 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(582214, 60549, 13136, '<td valign="top">The stereo shows no definition to distinguish it from the background. Interesting idea, but I might have wanted to se the difference, even in a small way.</td>', 'The stereo shows no definition to distinguish it from the background. Interesting idea, but I might have wanted to se the difference, even in a small way.', '2004-02-16 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(582218, 60242, 13136, '<td valign="top">A good study with contrast between the halves of the shot. Just the right amount of light on the face.</td>', 'A good study with contrast between the halves of the shot. Just the right amount of light on the face.', '2004-02-16 17:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(582222, 60578, 13136, '<td valign="top">One of the few color shots in this challenge. Good to see that you resisted the stereotype of getting so close as to fill the frame with the face.</td>', 'One of the few color shots in this challenge. Good to see that you resisted the stereotype of getting so close as to fill the frame with the face.', '2004-02-16 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(582225, 60184, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the flame. Not sure I like not being able to see even a dim outline of the candle sides. Interesting shot.</td>', 'I like the flame. Not sure I like not being able to see even a dim outline of the candle sides. Interesting shot.', '2004-02-16 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(582228, 60341, 13136, '<td valign="top">Overexposure makes this more of a grey shot than black. It makes the fingers look like wax.</td>', 'Overexposure makes this more of a grey shot than black. It makes the fingers look like wax.', '2004-02-16 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(582230, 60497, 13136, '<td valign="top">This shot is full of power yet still almost looks like a toy.</td>', 'This shot is full of power yet still almost looks like a toy.', '2004-02-16 17:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(582234, 60292, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to think about this. Maybe a white background to make the black stand out better? Maybe not.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to think about this. Maybe a white background to make the black stand out better? Maybe not.', '2004-02-16 17:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(582235, 60697, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done I think you will be going for the top 3 for Sure.....Great DOF and very sharp image...I would have given you a 10</td>', 'Very nicely done I think you will be going for the top 3 for Sure.....Great DOF and very sharp image...I would have given you a 10', '2004-02-16 17:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(582237, 60636, 13136, '<td valign="top">Has a lot of the feel of the famous MacIntosh Commercial. Good shot.</td>', 'Has a lot of the feel of the famous MacIntosh Commercial. Good shot.', '2004-02-16 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(582239, 60159, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are saying with this shot. The dimness does not work very well for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are saying with this shot. The dimness does not work very well for me.', '2004-02-16 17:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(582241, 60164, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and detailed ....I would have gave you a 10</td>', 'Very sharp and detailed ....I would have gave you a 10', '2004-02-16 17:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(582244, 60465, 11241, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  This is one of my top picks</td>', 'Great shot!  This is one of my top picks', '2004-02-16 17:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(582250, 60341, 11241, '<td valign="top">By the Look of that Len cap I say you have a SONY F717 camera like me...hehe</td>', 'By the Look of that Len cap I say you have a SONY F717 camera like me...hehe', '2004-02-16 17:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(582251, 60392, 3102, '<td valign="top">I remember those things!  It''s funny how archaic a typewriter seems nowadays!  This picture reminds me of the frustration of getting all of the keys jammed up, followed by all of the black goo I''d get on my hands in an effort to untangle them.</td>', 'I remember those things!  It''s funny how archaic a typewriter seems nowadays!  This picture reminds me of the frustration of getting all of the keys jammed up, followed by all of the black goo I''d get on my hands in an effort to untangle them.', '2004-02-16 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(582254, 60294, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very cool Idea you have there</td>', 'Very cool Idea you have there', '2004-02-16 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(582257, 60112, 3102, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much stronger without the border, or at least with a border of a different color...</td>', 'I think this would have been much stronger without the border, or at least with a border of a different color...', '2004-02-16 17:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(582260, 60687, 3102, '<td valign="top">There''s not much of anything I can see here, in all honesty...</td>', 'There''s not much of anything I can see here, in all honesty...', '2004-02-16 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(582264, 60227, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I love the crispness of the 8-ball, and the nice reflection... and the fact that you got that reflection without getting yourself and the camera in there.  Kudos!</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I love the crispness of the 8-ball, and the nice reflection... and the fact that you got that reflection without getting yourself and the camera in there.  Kudos!', '2004-02-16 17:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(582279, 60665, 3102, '<td valign="top">No offense, but I may pass up an invitation to dinner at your place :)  Nice photo, though!</td>', 'No offense, but I may pass up an invitation to dinner at your place :)  Nice photo, though!', '2004-02-16 18:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(582296, 60391, 806, '<td valign="top">very dramatic effect with the lighting and subject matter.</td>', 'very dramatic effect with the lighting and subject matter.', '2004-02-16 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(582297, 60606, 806, '<td valign="top">I like how you made this feel 3D. This means good lighting and focus.</td>', 'I like how you made this feel 3D. This means good lighting and focus.', '2004-02-16 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(582299, 60182, 806, '<td valign="top">nicely done exposure and composition.</td>', 'nicely done exposure and composition.', '2004-02-16 18:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(582301, 60280, 806, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.. mediocre interest level over time in a shoe... :)</td>', 'nice lighting.. mediocre interest level over time in a shoe... :)', '2004-02-16 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(582302, 60202, 806, '<td valign="top">good focus, composition, interest level is high.</td>', 'good focus, composition, interest level is high.', '2004-02-16 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(582305, 60603, 806, '<td valign="top">what a graphic and edgy image! Is this in infrared? or is it inverted? cool effect!</td>', 'what a graphic and edgy image! Is this in infrared? or is it inverted? cool effect!', '2004-02-16 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(582306, 60570, 806, '<td valign="top">focus is way off on this shot.</td>', 'focus is way off on this shot.', '2004-02-16 18:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(582314, 60543, 806, '<td valign="top">great mood, lighting, subject, ... nice creative juices flowing... her eyes are captivating.. I feel that I have stumbled into a private moment.</td>', 'great mood, lighting, subject, ... nice creative juices flowing... her eyes are captivating.. I feel that I have stumbled into a private moment.', '2004-02-16 18:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(582316, 60082, 806, '<td valign="top">somehow I am drawn into this photograph. nicely done.</td>', 'somehow I am drawn into this photograph. nicely done.', '2004-02-16 18:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(582322, 60570, 327, '<td valign="top">Where is the focus in your shot? The black olives appear to be grey and the green one looks light grey. I think b&amp;w didn''t help this shot but I do know that focus would have. Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'Where is the focus in your shot? The black olives appear to be grey and the green one looks light grey. I think b&w didn''t help this shot but I do know that focus would have. Good luck in the challenge', '2004-02-16 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(582329, 60462, 327, '<td valign="top">I think you must be showing me a vain of coal? Right. I can only guess because there is no way to tell what this is, and that''s hard to vote on. Sorry. I see the title but it''s really not something interesting to look at. Maybe if you had moved back away a bit.</td>', 'I think you must be showing me a vain of coal? Right. I can only guess because there is no way to tell what this is, and that''s hard to vote on. Sorry. I see the title but it''s really not something interesting to look at. Maybe if you had moved back away a bit.', '2004-02-16 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(582330, 60696, 14620, '<td valign="top">The color seems way off on this, why are there green things in your chocolate?  Kinda leaves an unappealing taste in my mouth and I soooo love chocolate. As far as the technical aspects (other than the color)  Seems a little too close up, and the purple background distracts from your subject a bit as well as the scratches in the chocolate. It is in focus but might be cropped just a little too tightly. It is black, therefore fitting the challenge.   But again, these are just my views and I hope they''re helpful. :)</td>', 'The color seems way off on this, why are there green things in your chocolate?  Kinda leaves an unappealing taste in my mouth and I soooo love chocolate. As far as the technical aspects (other than the color)  Seems a little too close up, and the purple background distracts from your subject a bit as well as the scratches in the chocolate. It is in focus but might be cropped just a little too tightly. It is black, therefore fitting the challenge.   But again, these are just my views and I hope they''re helpful. :)', '2004-02-16 18:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(582333, 60655, 14620, '<td valign="top">Barely... just a little too dark.  Can''t quite define the edges of your subject.</td>', 'Barely... just a little too dark.  Can''t quite define the edges of your subject.', '2004-02-16 18:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(582335, 60533, 327, '<td valign="top">I had to save this, lighten it and look for a long time to see that this is a hand ...with a ?Michael Jackson glove? reaching for the statue. The focus is on the ?cylinder/vase on the right. Sorry.</td>', 'I had to save this, lighten it and look for a long time to see that this is a hand ...with a ?Michael Jackson glove? reaching for the statue. The focus is on the ?cylinder/vase on the right. Sorry.', '2004-02-16 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(582336, 60570, 14620, '<td valign="top">I would''ve boosted the contrasts on this much more, as it stands now your Black olives look grey.  I like the idea you were going with, using the lighter olive to offset the black ones.</td>', 'I would''ve boosted the contrasts on this much more, as it stands now your Black olives look grey.  I like the idea you were going with, using the lighter olive to offset the black ones.', '2004-02-16 18:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(582340, 60463, 327, '<td valign="top">Fine idea for the challenge. I think a tighter crop would of drawn the viewers eye in and given this more of a punch.</td>', 'Fine idea for the challenge. I think a tighter crop would of drawn the viewers eye in and given this more of a punch.', '2004-02-16 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
