(582465, 60541, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I think you turned the contrast up a little too much, the white bottle cap blends into the background which I don''t like. Having a bigger depth of field so that the bottom of the letters was in focus would also help. But overall, a great job, it stands out from the rest of the entries</td>', 'I like the idea. I think you turned the contrast up a little too much, the white bottle cap blends into the background which I don''t like. Having a bigger depth of field so that the bottom of the letters was in focus would also help. But overall, a great job, it stands out from the rest of the entries', '2004-02-16 19:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(582469, 60227, 17377, '<td valign="top">Great Work!  One of my favorites.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great Work!  One of my favorites.  Good Luck.', '2004-02-16 19:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(582470, 60390, 15330, '<td valign="top">The detail of the hand, and grains of coal is great. I also like that you used a black background, instead of white. That gives the shot a mood, and atmosphere. Having the hand dark all the way to the bottom right corner would bet better since the white of the hand is a little ditracting.</td>', 'The detail of the hand, and grains of coal is great. I also like that you used a black background, instead of white. That gives the shot a mood, and atmosphere. Having the hand dark all the way to the bottom right corner would bet better since the white of the hand is a little ditracting.', '2004-02-16 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(582474, 60239, 17377, '<td valign="top">Great detail and contrast.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Great detail and contrast.  Good Luck!', '2004-02-16 19:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(582478, 60663, 17377, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I would have liked to see this in black and white.</td>', 'Good composition.  I would have liked to see this in black and white.', '2004-02-16 19:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(582480, 60236, 15330, '<td valign="top">I think that the shallow depth of field could have been used better here. If you were trying to draw attention to the L you should''ve made it red to stand out. Try a different composition, the subject is too centered for my taste.</td>', 'I think that the shallow depth of field could have been used better here. If you were trying to draw attention to the L you should''ve made it red to stand out. Try a different composition, the subject is too centered for my taste.', '2004-02-16 19:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(582486, 60182, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the black vulture, and white bakground, but the vulture is so black that most of the detail in the wings, and feathers is lost. If there was more detail in the vulture this would be a much better photo.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the black vulture, and white bakground, but the vulture is so black that most of the detail in the wings, and feathers is lost. If there was more detail in the vulture this would be a much better photo.', '2004-02-16 19:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(582492, 60687, 11769, '<td valign="top">We dont get much darker than this. I love it.</td>', 'We dont get much darker than this. I love it.', '2004-02-16 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(582496, 60591, 11769, '<td valign="top">As it turns out space isnt exactly black. It is turquoise. So you dont meet the challenge.<br/>Just kidding. Great photo. Nice job. I am an amateur astronomer also so I appreciate this. <br/></td>', 'As it turns out space isnt exactly black. It is turquoise. So you dont meet the challenge.Just kidding. Great photo. Nice job. I am an amateur astronomer also so I appreciate this. ', '2004-02-16 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(582503, 60159, 11769, '<td valign="top">If I put my head at an angle to the screen I can just barely make this one out. What was left behind was any sort of a light source.<br/>Sorry, just pulling your leg. A wonderful entry for the Challenge. One of my favorites. 10<br/></td>', 'If I put my head at an angle to the screen I can just barely make this one out. What was left behind was any sort of a light source.Sorry, just pulling your leg. A wonderful entry for the Challenge. One of my favorites. 10', '2004-02-16 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(582504, 60606, 11769, '<td valign="top">I vote you the winner. No need to go any further. Exquisite. 10+</td>', 'I vote you the winner. No need to go any further. Exquisite. 10+', '2004-02-16 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
