(582927, 60320, 245, '<td valign="top">I like this shot! I wish there were a larger depth of field though, seeing sharp fur along the nose would add some nice black texture to frame the already really striking eye. I''d also bump the eye maybe 5% or so to the left (or crop some of the left side), I think it would make the eye and and the strip of hilights in the fur sit nicely.<br/></td>', 'I like this shot! I wish there were a larger depth of field though, seeing sharp fur along the nose would add some nice black texture to frame the already really striking eye. I''d also bump the eye maybe 5% or so to the left (or crop some of the left side), I think it would make the eye and and the strip of hilights in the fur sit nicely.', '2004-02-17 06:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(582928, 60544, 245, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a black challenge, but ths looks underexposed, could you have lightened the hilights a bit more?</td>', 'I know it''s a black challenge, but ths looks underexposed, could you have lightened the hilights a bit more?', '2004-02-17 06:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(582929, 60524, 245, '<td valign="top">I really like simple images, but I''d like to see some tweaking to make the reflections off the bag a bit more interesting, you could play the blue and yellow tinted lighting off each other nicely with a few more wriknles, I bet. I like that it adds color to the black bag, showing that you still see black even if it''s actually a variety of colors.</td>', 'I really like simple images, but I''d like to see some tweaking to make the reflections off the bag a bit more interesting, you could play the blue and yellow tinted lighting off each other nicely with a few more wriknles, I bet. I like that it adds color to the black bag, showing that you still see black even if it''s actually a variety of colors.', '2004-02-17 06:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(582932, 60286, 245, '<td valign="top">pretty creepy, but it still looks like a cheese grater to me. :)</td>', 'pretty creepy, but it still looks like a cheese grater to me. :)', '2004-02-17 06:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(582933, 60483, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the uncertianty of this, it makes me tense.</td>', 'I like the uncertianty of this, it makes me tense.', '2004-02-17 06:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(582934, 60510, 245, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the exposure a bit darker so I can see details of the bulb''s filament. It would help disguise distracting imperfections in the glass, too!</td>', 'I''d like to see the exposure a bit darker so I can see details of the bulb''s filament. It would help disguise distracting imperfections in the glass, too!', '2004-02-17 06:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(582936, 60685, 245, '<td valign="top">Very nice blue-black, it goes great with the very saturated rose. The red of the rose looks a little hot to me, but the green is excellent. I also like the cat''s expression even though it''s not facing the camera. It looks thoughtful!</td>', 'Very nice blue-black, it goes great with the very saturated rose. The red of the rose looks a little hot to me, but the green is excellent. I also like the cat''s expression even though it''s not facing the camera. It looks thoughtful!', '2004-02-17 06:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(582937, 60159, 245, '<td valign="top">Freaky! I want to see this wth the lights just a little lighter, to make it pop a bit more, in the very hilights.</td>', 'Freaky! I want to see this wth the lights just a little lighter, to make it pop a bit more, in the very hilights.', '2004-02-17 06:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(582939, 60238, 245, '<td valign="top">I would have tried framing this picture down and to the right a little bit more, about 5% or so. Otherwise, it''s quite nice!</td>', 'I would have tried framing this picture down and to the right a little bit more, about 5% or so. Otherwise, it''s quite nice!', '2004-02-17 06:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(582940, 60222, 245, '<td valign="top">I think the hot exposure on the stamen (pistil?) works quite nicely in this insatnce, It makes the flower glow.</td>', 'I think the hot exposure on the stamen (pistil?) works quite nicely in this insatnce, It makes the flower glow.', '2004-02-17 06:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(582941, 60242, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice, you''ve captured a distinct mood here. I would have tried framing it to the left somewhat, showing more of the curtains (or cropping off some of the right), even though this is a ''black'' challenge. :)</td>', 'Nice, you''ve captured a distinct mood here. I would have tried framing it to the left somewhat, showing more of the curtains (or cropping off some of the right), even though this is a ''black'' challenge. :)', '2004-02-17 06:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(582942, 60381, 245, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this, it''s vaguely disturing. :) The focus could be a bit sharper towards the back near the tip of the hooks, too!</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this, it''s vaguely disturing. :) The focus could be a bit sharper towards the back near the tip of the hooks, too!', '2004-02-17 07:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
