(582965, 60394, 245, '<td valign="top">The framing feels a little low and to the left to me, and the exposure on the highlights a bit hot, but otherwise this is a nice exposure. :)</td>', 'The framing feels a little low and to the left to me, and the exposure on the highlights a bit hot, but otherwise this is a nice exposure. :)', '2004-02-17 07:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(582967, 60672, 245, '<td valign="top">I''m taking points away for the lack of ''blackness'', but it''s a nice sunset.</td>', 'I''m taking points away for the lack of ''blackness'', but it''s a nice sunset.', '2004-02-17 07:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(582968, 60566, 245, '<td valign="top">I want to see the flame centered over the mug so you can see the reflection in the center of the coffee!</td>', 'I want to see the flame centered over the mug so you can see the reflection in the center of the coffee!', '2004-02-17 07:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(582972, 60696, 245, '<td valign="top">The purple underneath the chocolte detractes from the image, I think... it''s distracting.</td>', 'The purple underneath the chocolte detractes from the image, I think... it''s distracting.', '2004-02-17 07:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(582973, 60534, 245, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, moody.</td>', 'Very pretty, moody.', '2004-02-17 07:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(582976, 60665, 245, '<td valign="top">I''m a stickler for absolute perfect symmetry in pictures like this, and the plate seems a bit tilted to the right to me. :) I would have also lined the plate up with the pattern on the tablecloth, but I''m compulsive!</td>', 'I''m a stickler for absolute perfect symmetry in pictures like this, and the plate seems a bit tilted to the right to me. :) I would have also lined the plate up with the pattern on the tablecloth, but I''m compulsive!', '2004-02-17 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(582977, 60318, 245, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice subtle blues and pinks in the background!</td>', 'Lots of nice subtle blues and pinks in the background!', '2004-02-17 07:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(582978, 60097, 245, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus were a lot crisper, but the blue in the coffee is cool!</td>', 'I wish the focus were a lot crisper, but the blue in the coffee is cool!', '2004-02-17 07:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(582981, 60492, 245, '<td valign="top">Cute, simple picture, with flawless gradients. Nice! :)</td>', 'Cute, simple picture, with flawless gradients. Nice! :)', '2004-02-17 07:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(582984, 60390, 245, '<td valign="top">Great detail and exposure, but I think the framing is off. There''s too much black on the left side, the hand doesn''t seem to rest well to me.</td>', 'Great detail and exposure, but I think the framing is off. There''s too much black on the left side, the hand doesn''t seem to rest well to me.', '2004-02-17 07:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(582985, 60465, 245, '<td valign="top">Lone? ;)</td>', 'Lone? ;)', '2004-02-17 07:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(582988, 60201, 245, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft or the image oo blurred to stand out for me. I think it would help if you framed the subjects to the left about 5% or so, as well.</td>', 'The focus is too soft or the image oo blurred to stand out for me. I think it would help if you framed the subjects to the left about 5% or so, as well.', '2004-02-17 07:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(582991, 60082, 245, '<td valign="top">This kicks butt. I love how deep the picture is, with lots of detail way back into the scene!</td>', 'This kicks butt. I love how deep the picture is, with lots of detail way back into the scene!', '2004-02-17 07:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(582994, 60669, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color while still reading ''black'', but the subject is a bit uninteresting for me...</td>', 'Nice use of color while still reading ''black'', but the subject is a bit uninteresting for me...', '2004-02-17 07:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(583001, 60269, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the smooth gradients and subtle detail, but if you cropped off the top 5% to push the shiny metal all the way to the edge I think the lines would be a lot nicer! :)<br/></td>', 'I like the smooth gradients and subtle detail, but if you cropped off the top 5% to push the shiny metal all the way to the edge I think the lines would be a lot nicer! :)', '2004-02-17 07:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(583002, 60106, 245, '<td valign="top">Try centering the stone in the frame, perhaps.</td>', 'Try centering the stone in the frame, perhaps.', '2004-02-17 07:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(583005, 60606, 245, '<td valign="top">I thnk the hilights could be a lot brighter if you pushed the blacks blacker as well.<br/></td>', 'I thnk the hilights could be a lot brighter if you pushed the blacks blacker as well.', '2004-02-17 07:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(583006, 60442, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice blues in the back, they contrast with the board nicely.</td>', 'Nice blues in the back, they contrast with the board nicely.', '2004-02-17 07:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(583010, 60153, 245, '<td valign="top">For a picture like this to work for me, the perspective has to be spot on, all lines as horizontal or vertical a can be. Increasing the contrast would help, too!</td>', 'For a picture like this to work for me, the perspective has to be spot on, all lines as horizontal or vertical a can be. Increasing the contrast would help, too!', '2004-02-17 07:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(583013, 60531, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and exposure, the narrow depth of field looks good, too!</td>', 'Nice detail and exposure, the narrow depth of field looks good, too!', '2004-02-17 07:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(583015, 60094, 245, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cute! I wish the wrist were further from the edge, though.</td>', 'This is pretty cute! I wish the wrist were further from the edge, though.', '2004-02-17 07:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(583018, 60301, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice marketing shot, very crisp and dynamic. :) I would have ried it with the frme shifted right a bit, centering the logo and knob</td>', 'Nice marketing shot, very crisp and dynamic. :) I would have ried it with the frme shifted right a bit, centering the logo and knob', '2004-02-17 07:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(583021, 60689, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice not-black black entry! That car totally picks up the environment around it!</td>', 'Nice not-black black entry! That car totally picks up the environment around it!', '2004-02-17 07:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(583022, 60636, 245, '<td valign="top">Creepy</td>', 'Creepy', '2004-02-17 07:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(583024, 60585, 245, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean!</td>', 'Simple and clean!', '2004-02-17 07:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(583025, 60663, 245, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I woulld have left a little more yellow around the center of the flower, and rotated it until the torn petal were off-frame.</td>', 'I like it, but I woulld have left a little more yellow around the center of the flower, and rotated it until the torn petal were off-frame.', '2004-02-17 07:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(583027, 60292, 245, '<td valign="top">*Almost* perfectly symmetrical... so close... :)</td>', '*Almost* perfectly symmetrical... so close... :)', '2004-02-17 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(583029, 60227, 245, '<td valign="top">Great timing, DOF, and that ball is *really* smooth looking. Excellent work!</td>', 'Great timing, DOF, and that ball is *really* smooth looking. Excellent work!', '2004-02-17 07:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(583031, 60628, 245, '<td valign="top">Very hot exposure, could be darker.</td>', 'Very hot exposure, could be darker.', '2004-02-17 07:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(583033, 60214, 245, '<td valign="top">This feels underexposed to me.<br/></td>', 'This feels underexposed to me.', '2004-02-17 07:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(583036, 60391, 245, '<td valign="top">That is totally freaky!</td>', 'That is totally freaky!', '2004-02-17 07:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(583037, 60469, 245, '<td valign="top">That is one desolate looking wall of rocks!</td>', 'That is one desolate looking wall of rocks!', '2004-02-17 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(583040, 60187, 245, '<td valign="top">I think the border detracts from the image, it''s much too bold!</td>', 'I think the border detracts from the image, it''s much too bold!', '2004-02-17 08:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(583041, 60570, 245, '<td valign="top">This could use more contrast, I think... The black olives look gray!</td>', 'This could use more contrast, I think... The black olives look gray!', '2004-02-17 08:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(583044, 60294, 245, '<td valign="top">Cute, I like it.</td>', 'Cute, I like it.', '2004-02-17 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(583046, 60224, 245, '<td valign="top">I''m not reading much balance, it seems right-heavy to me. Great detail though!</td>', 'I''m not reading much balance, it seems right-heavy to me. Great detail though!', '2004-02-17 08:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(583048, 60164, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, bland subject</td>', 'Nice exposure, bland subject', '2004-02-17 08:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(583054, 60227, 16052, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to like here.  Great focus, contrast and depth of field.  Composition excellent.  Lot of interest points: shooter''s expression, cue ball movement, line of sight, 8 ball precariously positioned, window reflection on 8 ball, etc.  Well done.</td>', 'There''s a lot to like here.  Great focus, contrast and depth of field.  Composition excellent.  Lot of interest points: shooter''s expression, cue ball movement, line of sight, 8 ball precariously positioned, window reflection on 8 ball, etc.  Well done.', '2004-02-17 08:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(583060, 60233, 16052, '<td valign="top">Appears to me to be oversaturated.  Very interesting composition though.</td>', 'Appears to me to be oversaturated.  Very interesting composition though.', '2004-02-17 08:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(583063, 60577, 16052, '<td valign="top">Gotta love that eye color!  Wish that blacks were deeper and fan edge was sharper focus, i.e., just slightly greater depth of field.</td>', 'Gotta love that eye color!  Wish that blacks were deeper and fan edge was sharper focus, i.e., just slightly greater depth of field.', '2004-02-17 08:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(583066, 60469, 16052, '<td valign="top">I love your composition here.  Bare feet on black clothed subject are brilliant.  Cave rocks scattered about are beautifully in focus and add greatly to interest.</td>', 'I love your composition here.  Bare feet on black clothed subject are brilliant.  Cave rocks scattered about are beautifully in focus and add greatly to interest.', '2004-02-17 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(583070, 60213, 16052, '<td valign="top">Focus and depth of field need to be improved.</td>', 'Focus and depth of field need to be improved.', '2004-02-17 08:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(583074, 60236, 16052, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is shallow here and too limiting.</td>', 'Depth of field is shallow here and too limiting.', '2004-02-17 08:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(583084, 60591, 16052, '<td valign="top">I can clearly make out Orion in the night sky here.  Good night sky picture.  Trees to left are bit distracting, but mountain range in background plays well.</td>', 'I can clearly make out Orion in the night sky here.  Good night sky picture.  Trees to left are bit distracting, but mountain range in background plays well.', '2004-02-17 08:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(583089, 60570, 16052, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but needs much greater depth of field here.</td>', 'Interesting, but needs much greater depth of field here.', '2004-02-17 08:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(583090, 60112, 16052, '<td valign="top">I know that you heard it before, but dump the yellow border.  It takes but dosen''t give here.  Lighting a bit harsh here but I like the composition and effect.</td>', 'I know that you heard it before, but dump the yellow border.  It takes but dosen''t give here.  Lighting a bit harsh here but I like the composition and effect.', '2004-02-17 08:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(583092, 60201, 1643, '<td valign="top">Focal point not sharp</td>', 'Focal point not sharp', '2004-02-17 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(583093, 60391, 16052, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Great composition and highly provocative.</td>', 'I like this.  Great composition and highly provocative.', '2004-02-17 08:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(583101, 60094, 11800, '<td valign="top">Mostly well exposed, some of the highlights are overexposed. The yellow and green adds a dynamic touch. I''m giving this a good score,7. Beautiful sculpture.<br/>These are personal reflections on this image: I would like it cropped at the wrist so the hand fills the frame. I''m wondering how it would have looked with the weed repeating the movement of the fingers by being turned 90 degrees.</td>', 'Mostly well exposed, some of the highlights are overexposed. The yellow and green adds a dynamic touch. I''m giving this a good score,7. Beautiful sculpture.These are personal reflections on this image: I would like it cropped at the wrist so the hand fills the frame. I''m wondering how it would have looked with the weed repeating the movement of the fingers by being turned 90 degrees.', '2004-02-17 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(583104, 60506, 11800, '<td valign="top">All of the details are captured and I do get a feeling of action from the shot.</td>', 'All of the details are captured and I do get a feeling of action from the shot.', '2004-02-17 09:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(583111, 60096, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasant photo to look at. The orange band gives it a bit of visual appeal. To me, the blue tone on the black hats gives it an underexposed feeling. Perhaps if it was toned sepia, I wouldn''t feel that it is underexposed?</td>', 'This is a pleasant photo to look at. The orange band gives it a bit of visual appeal. To me, the blue tone on the black hats gives it an underexposed feeling. Perhaps if it was toned sepia, I wouldn''t feel that it is underexposed?', '2004-02-17 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(583113, 60067, 11800, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh. Good job!  Minimal to the extreme, but very well done. I can follow the edge all the way down to the stem.</td>', 'Ohhhh. Good job!  Minimal to the extreme, but very well done. I can follow the edge all the way down to the stem.', '2004-02-17 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(583116, 60202, 11800, '<td valign="top">S/he looks to be almost human except for the whiskers. Wonderful job.</td>', 'S/he looks to be almost human except for the whiskers. Wonderful job.', '2004-02-17 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(583117, 60238, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird. I know you''ve heard this by now, but the focus is off. Sorry.</td>', 'Pretty bird. I know you''ve heard this by now, but the focus is off. Sorry.', '2004-02-17 09:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(583130, 60663, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear, nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Very crisp and clear, nice use of negative space.', '2004-02-17 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(583133, 60390, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of neat image but on this one it improved the luminosity(?) so that''s a plus, but it left smudgy areas (the right side of the hand and his fingers mostly) so that''s a minus. I like the composition and the fact that the hand is covered with the coal dust and it''s even under the nails. That makes it more real. I think I would like this more if the noise had been left in or even increased. 7</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of neat image but on this one it improved the luminosity(?) so that''s a plus, but it left smudgy areas (the right side of the hand and his fingers mostly) so that''s a minus. I like the composition and the fact that the hand is covered with the coal dust and it''s even under the nails. That makes it more real. I think I would like this more if the noise had been left in or even increased. 7', '2004-02-17 09:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(583134, 60227, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice work :)  I would have given this a 10 instead of a 9 if you could have decided on a title :)</td>', 'Very nice work :)  I would have given this a 10 instead of a 9 if you could have decided on a title :)', '2004-02-17 10:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(583135, 60280, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good focus. A bit of lightening at the top and I think a better angle on the show would help.</td>', 'Good focus. A bit of lightening at the top and I think a better angle on the show would help.', '2004-02-17 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(583137, 60692, 11800, '<td valign="top">Why is the center text all blurry? It''s on the same focal plane, isn''t it? That''s really too bad because this is such a well composed picture.</td>', 'Why is the center text all blurry? It''s on the same focal plane, isn''t it? That''s really too bad because this is such a well composed picture.', '2004-02-17 10:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(583141, 60414, 13136, '<td valign="top">Is this one of the cat shots? Good to see some white in the shot also.</td>', 'Is this one of the cat shots? Good to see some white in the shot also.', '2004-02-17 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(583142, 60539, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2004-02-17 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(583143, 60650, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Would do well in ''Textures II''. Good job of keeping down the light reflections.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Would do well in ''Textures II''. Good job of keeping down the light reflections.', '2004-02-17 10:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(583144, 60236, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good use of white background. Interesting choice of DOF.</td>', 'Good use of white background. Interesting choice of DOF.', '2004-02-17 10:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(583149, 60286, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what I''m looking at here. Cargo bay of an alien spaceship? Cat Crate? I like the lost-in-the-darkness back of the space.</td>', 'Not really sure what I''m looking at here. Cargo bay of an alien spaceship? Cat Crate? I like the lost-in-the-darkness back of the space.', '2004-02-17 10:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(583151, 60687, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not even a mid gray. You are a brave soul. Not too exciting but technically superb.</td>', 'Nice. Not even a mid gray. You are a brave soul. Not too exciting but technically superb.', '2004-02-17 10:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(583153, 60106, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the DOF choice here. Looking a bit more, I guess having the darker parts in focus and the lighter parts out of focus is a good thing.</td>', 'Not sure I like the DOF choice here. Looking a bit more, I guess having the darker parts in focus and the lighter parts out of focus is a good thing.', '2004-02-17 10:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(583154, 60566, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the framing. Not sure I like the blurred spoon and Creamer(?). Good use of negative space.</td>', 'I like the framing. Not sure I like the blurred spoon and Creamer(?). Good use of negative space.', '2004-02-17 10:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(583156, 60268, 13136, '<td valign="top">This kinda freaks me out. Interesting idea.</td>', 'This kinda freaks me out. Interesting idea.', '2004-02-17 10:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(583158, 60677, 13136, '<td valign="top">Different. Good choice. I like the composition and lighting as well as the DOF choice.</td>', 'Different. Good choice. I like the composition and lighting as well as the DOF choice.', '2004-02-17 10:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(583159, 60579, 13136, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I like the focus choice in this shot. Good idea and composition.</td>', 'Can''t say I like the focus choice in this shot. Good idea and composition.', '2004-02-17 10:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(583160, 60067, 13136, '<td valign="top">Almost seems to take up too much of the picture. Seems like you need to back out a little.</td>', 'Almost seems to take up too much of the picture. Seems like you need to back out a little.', '2004-02-17 10:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(583168, 60294, 2952, '<td valign="top">The texture of the dirt could have been enhanced if you''d stopped down just a tad...otherwise, very creative!</td>', 'The texture of the dirt could have been enhanced if you''d stopped down just a tad...otherwise, very creative!', '2004-02-17 10:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(583170, 60196, 2952, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting!  Softbox?</td>', 'Love the lighting!  Softbox?', '2004-02-17 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(583171, 60227, 2952, '<td valign="top">Love it!! Do it with a tripod and self-timer?  Nice, nice, nice!</td>', 'Love it!! Do it with a tripod and self-timer?  Nice, nice, nice!', '2004-02-17 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(583174, 60492, 2952, '<td valign="top">Very creative -- would like to hear how this one was set up!  But I love the stark contrast, moving into the gradient!  Great!</td>', 'Very creative -- would like to hear how this one was set up!  But I love the stark contrast, moving into the gradient!  Great!', '2004-02-17 10:24:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(583175, 60390, 2952, '<td valign="top">PERFECT depth of field to capture every bit of gritty texture!!</td>', 'PERFECT depth of field to capture every bit of gritty texture!!', '2004-02-17 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(583177, 60548, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. May be a little better if you backed out a bit, but I like the contrast with the glack and green. Good to see a ''black'' shot in color.</td>', 'I like this shot. May be a little better if you backed out a bit, but I like the contrast with the glack and green. Good to see a ''black'' shot in color.', '2004-02-17 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(583178, 60204, 13136, '<td valign="top">Funny shot. Whould it work a bit better if you backed out a little? I like the black/red contrast.</td>', 'Funny shot. Whould it work a bit better if you backed out a little? I like the black/red contrast.', '2004-02-17 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(583180, 60636, 2952, '<td valign="top">I think this one should win just because...!  Other than that, I love the look B/W gave to the interesting stonework of the building!  Great job!</td>', 'I think this one should win just because...!  Other than that, I love the look B/W gave to the interesting stonework of the building!  Great job!', '2004-02-17 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(583181, 60416, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good to see some color contrast in this ''Black'' challenge. Interesting subject choice.</td>', 'Good to see some color contrast in this ''Black'' challenge. Interesting subject choice.', '2004-02-17 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(583183, 60398, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Even got a reflection of ''Bird Butt'' in the water.</td>', 'Nice shot. Even got a reflection of ''Bird Butt'' in the water.', '2004-02-17 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(583184, 60677, 5391, '<td valign="top">The problem with photographing a number is that I suspect people might subliminally vote "5"...  I almost just did, maybe because I haven''t had my coffee yet today.  :)  Nice details, focus, composition and dramatic lighting.  7</td>', 'The problem with photographing a number is that I suspect people might subliminally vote "5"...  I almost just did, maybe because I haven''t had my coffee yet today.  :)  Nice details, focus, composition and dramatic lighting.  7', '2004-02-17 10:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(583185, 60500, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not real sure about this shot. Is the black center natural to this mint or set up?</td>', 'Not real sure about this shot. Is the black center natural to this mint or set up?', '2004-02-17 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(583187, 60178, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice composition, lovely light.  You can really feel the smooth texture of the chocolate.  8</td>', 'Very pretty, nice composition, lovely light.  You can really feel the smooth texture of the chocolate.  8', '2004-02-17 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(583188, 60660, 13136, '<td valign="top">First thought was "interesting". Then I looked at the title and didn''t think anything of it. Then I wondered what was reflected in the glasses. Then I figured it out. Real sneaky shot.</td>', 'First thought was "interesting". Then I looked at the title and didn''t think anything of it. Then I wondered what was reflected in the glasses. Then I figured it out. Real sneaky shot.', '2004-02-17 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(583190, 60227, 10608, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a common topic</td>', 'Great photo of a common topic', '2004-02-17 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(583191, 60591, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Good job of keeping the sky black in a timed exposure. Mine always end up grey.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Good job of keeping the sky black in a timed exposure. Mine always end up grey.', '2004-02-17 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(583195, 60096, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. Did not like the orange border until I realized it went with the band on the hat.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. Did not like the orange border until I realized it went with the band on the hat.', '2004-02-17 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(583196, 60301, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good use of spotlight. Glad to see some color in the shot as well.</td>', 'Good use of spotlight. Glad to see some color in the shot as well.', '2004-02-17 10:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(583199, 60097, 13136, '<td valign="top">A bit too grainy and out of focus for me.</td>', 'A bit too grainy and out of focus for me.', '2004-02-17 10:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(583200, 60685, 13136, '<td valign="top">You managed to get good definition on the cat''s hairs in this shot. Good contrast of black and red.</td>', 'You managed to get good definition on the cat''s hairs in this shot. Good contrast of black and red.', '2004-02-17 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(583207, 60392, 13136, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Good composition. You got me looking at the keys trying to see if they spell anything. Hven''t found anything yet.</td>', 'Neat idea. Good composition. You got me looking at the keys trying to see if they spell anything. Hven''t found anything yet.', '2004-02-17 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
