(583220, 60573, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good to see the touch of blue sky. Silhouettes usually are good for a ''black'' challenge. Just not sure of the composition.</td>', 'Good to see the touch of blue sky. Silhouettes usually are good for a ''black'' challenge. Just not sure of the composition.', '2004-02-17 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(583229, 60591, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice night image and well composed. Trees, hill and stars balance the image nicely.  My eldest son is named Orion after this great hunter in the sky. It is the only constellation with three first magnitude stars and home to the Great Orion Nebula (clearly visible here) and the Horsehead Nebula among other things.</td>', 'Nice night image and well composed. Trees, hill and stars balance the image nicely.  My eldest son is named Orion after this great hunter in the sky. It is the only constellation with three first magnitude stars and home to the Great Orion Nebula (clearly visible here) and the Horsehead Nebula among other things.', '2004-02-17 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(583236, 60697, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good composition. I want that camera.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good composition. I want that camera.', '2004-02-17 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(583237, 60655, 13136, '<td valign="top">No.</td>', 'No.', '2004-02-17 11:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
