(586097, 60577, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull! One of my very favorits! Very mystic with great clarity. The selective decoloration works like magic her. Hope you win. good luck.</td>', 'Wonderfull! One of my very favorits! Very mystic with great clarity. The selective decoloration works like magic her. Hope you win. good luck.', '2004-02-18 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586106, 60515, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like this very much: the angle of view with you on the same hight as the flying bird is awesome and seldom seen. The background works great too. Also like the cropping. The bird could be a bit larger though. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this very much: the angle of view with you on the same hight as the flying bird is awesome and seldom seen. The background works great too. Also like the cropping. The bird could be a bit larger though. Good luck.', '2004-02-18 15:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(586109, 60531, 5158, '<td valign="top">While I like the way you did set the light and how you arranged the charcoal, I wonder why you did put them upside down! It moves the viers eyes away from the image, because he/she tries to read what is written on them. <br/>Anyway, a very godd submission. Good luck to you.</td>', 'While I like the way you did set the light and how you arranged the charcoal, I wonder why you did put them upside down! It moves the viers eyes away from the image, because he/she tries to read what is written on them. Anyway, a very godd submission. Good luck to you.', '2004-02-18 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(586120, 60492, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement with an awesome light and a very clean white. The image could be from a design study.  Hope you do very well.</td>', 'Great arrangement with an awesome light and a very clean white. The image could be from a design study.  Hope you do very well.', '2004-02-18 15:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(586128, 60603, 5158, '<td valign="top">While I would never put this on my livingroom wall, I like this strong entry very much. Great texture, awesome pose and how you set the contrast/levels is just on the spot.  Good luck.</td>', 'While I would never put this on my livingroom wall, I like this strong entry very much. Great texture, awesome pose and how you set the contrast/levels is just on the spot.  Good luck.', '2004-02-18 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(586147, 60606, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great, clean entry with wonderfull variation of blacks/grey. The suit itself does not say to much to me though.</td>', 'Great, clean entry with wonderfull variation of blacks/grey. The suit itself does not say to much to me though.', '2004-02-18 16:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(586266, 60675, 15129, '<td valign="top">Too dark, or it would have been really cool!</td>', 'Too dark, or it would have been really cool!', '2004-02-18 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(586275, 60390, 10149, '<td valign="top">9 good luck</td>', '9 good luck', '2004-02-18 16:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(586281, 60685, 10149, '<td valign="top">nice pic 9 good luck</td>', 'nice pic 9 good luck', '2004-02-18 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(586284, 60223, 10149, '<td valign="top">well done 8</td>', 'well done 8', '2004-02-18 16:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(586287, 60233, 10149, '<td valign="top">great shot 7</td>', 'great shot 7', '2004-02-18 16:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(586305, 60543, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work with light and shades of gray. <br/>Great, tasteful pose as well.<br/> <br/>The white of the eyes is very bright though, did you do that with dodging / selective brightening / result of sharpening playing tricks with the eye or is it completely natural and is the difference in tone just playing with my mind?<br/> <br/>Anyway, excellent work. One of my two tens for this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful work with light and shades of gray. Great, tasteful pose as well. The white of the eyes is very bright though, did you do that with dodging / selective brightening / result of sharpening playing tricks with the eye or is it completely natural and is the difference in tone just playing with my mind? Anyway, excellent work. One of my two tens for this challenge.', '2004-02-18 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(586312, 60159, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent work with the lighting &amp; toning. Good balance.<br/>Like the composition and mystic dark portrayal.<br/> <br/>One of the two winners of this challenge if I were the judge.</td>', 'Excellent work with the lighting & toning. Good balance.Like the composition and mystic dark portrayal. One of the two winners of this challenge if I were the judge.', '2004-02-18 17:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(586316, 60577, 3032, '<td valign="top">Grabbing eyes, great photo.<br/>Good composition, like the diagonal, makes it much more interesting. The addition of the stuff in the lower right corner is a good choice imho, when I think about the photo without it it somehow seems a lot duller.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Grabbing eyes, great photo.Good composition, like the diagonal, makes it much more interesting. The addition of the stuff in the lower right corner is a good choice imho, when I think about the photo without it it somehow seems a lot duller. ', '2004-02-18 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(586318, 60082, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, it seems to have so much depth. The boulder in the middle draws my eye.<br/>Nice dark toning, sets a mood like if the forrest has burned down. Perhaps it has, I don''t know, but it sure feels that way.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting photo, it seems to have so much depth. The boulder in the middle draws my eye.Nice dark toning, sets a mood like if the forrest has burned down. Perhaps it has, I don''t know, but it sure feels that way. ', '2004-02-18 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(586319, 60469, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work. All that space in relation to the small human figure perfectly reflects what your title says.</td>', 'Nice work. All that space in relation to the small human figure perfectly reflects what your title says.', '2004-02-18 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(586326, 60094, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the color brakes the black and white in a very succesful way. I like the composition with the space above and the positioning of the hand &amp; flower.</td>', 'Nice how the color brakes the black and white in a very succesful way. I like the composition with the space above and the positioning of the hand & flower.', '2004-02-18 17:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(586328, 60668, 3032, '<td valign="top">Composition as it should be. Lots of interesting lines going everywhere to keep the viewer busy.<br/>Good toning, works well with the subject (dark mood &amp; spiky things).</td>', 'Composition as it should be. Lots of interesting lines going everywhere to keep the viewer busy.Good toning, works well with the subject (dark mood & spiky things).', '2004-02-18 17:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586330, 60390, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I''d suggest to either crop it to a square or to let more of the arm into the frame. The space at the left isn''t really necessary and a slight move the left might make the composition more interesting as well. 9<br/></td>', 'Great idea. I''d suggest to either crop it to a square or to let more of the arm into the frame. The space at the left isn''t really necessary and a slight move the left might make the composition more interesting as well. 9', '2004-02-18 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(586331, 60492, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of the teapot and how therefore the shadows work out. Clean background makes it stand out well. It is just that the teapot stands on it own, not very interesting. Its the way how it goes from bright to dark that makes it interesting. 9</td>', 'I like the lighting of the teapot and how therefore the shadows work out. Clean background makes it stand out well. It is just that the teapot stands on it own, not very interesting. Its the way how it goes from bright to dark that makes it interesting. 9', '2004-02-18 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586344, 60525, 13897, '<td valign="top">Clever title.  Lighting and focus are great. 7</td>', 'Clever title.  Lighting and focus are great. 7', '2004-02-18 17:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586351, 60227, 13897, '<td valign="top">I wish that reflection wasn''t in the 8-ball. However, I still like this shot a lot. 8 The big question: "Did it go in"?</td>', 'I wish that reflection wasn''t in the 8-ball. However, I still like this shot a lot. 8 The big question: "Did it go in"?', '2004-02-18 17:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586447, 60411, 17508, '<td valign="top">An excellent yet simple experience in form and light.</td>', 'An excellent yet simple experience in form and light.', '2004-02-18 18:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586463, 60182, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see the original.  This appears to have had the contrast increased too much in order to make the bird look as black as possible, losing detail in the process.</td>', 'I''d love to see the original.  This appears to have had the contrast increased too much in order to make the bird look as black as possible, losing detail in the process.', '2004-02-18 18:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(586495, 60689, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, but the focus here seems to be on the lights which are not black.  Even most of the blackness of the car disappears as a result of light coloured reflections.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, but the focus here seems to be on the lights which are not black.  Even most of the blackness of the car disappears as a result of light coloured reflections.', '2004-02-18 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(586528, 60187, 13026, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture, except that some of the petals look green.</td>', 'This is a very nice picture, except that some of the petals look green.', '2004-02-18 19:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586533, 60576, 13026, '<td valign="top">This picture is very nice, but it is sort of hard to tell what the rose is, and you get a light glare on the front piano keys.  But over all, it is a beautiful picture.</td>', 'This picture is very nice, but it is sort of hard to tell what the rose is, and you get a light glare on the front piano keys.  But over all, it is a beautiful picture.', '2004-02-18 19:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(586621, 60603, 11800, '<td valign="top">The texture is spectacular. The reduction of the dynamic range makes this look edgy and tense, which is very good. I don''t know if I personally like the composition. The angle makes the fingers look short whereas if they were coming towards me they would look long as in "a long road of suffering".  Ah well, that''s just my opinion. It''s still an awesome photo.</td>', 'The texture is spectacular. The reduction of the dynamic range makes this look edgy and tense, which is very good. I don''t know if I personally like the composition. The angle makes the fingers look short whereas if they were coming towards me they would look long as in "a long road of suffering".  Ah well, that''s just my opinion. It''s still an awesome photo.', '2004-02-18 19:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586648, 60665, 11800, '<td valign="top">Presentable. A good choice of foods and they look yummy. Hope you don''t mind if I say some things about the picture. The two light sources are competing.  You have created two sets of shadows. Maybe if one of them had been diffused you wouldn''t have that problem. While the arrangement of the food on the plate is attractive, the picture itself lacks interest, I know because I have been told this lots of times. The green touch is nice but doesn''t add enough pizzaz. Don''t be afraid to get up close and let some of the image get oof. Food is one of the hardest things to photograph and this is a good attempt.</td>', 'Presentable. A good choice of foods and they look yummy. Hope you don''t mind if I say some things about the picture. The two light sources are competing.  You have created two sets of shadows. Maybe if one of them had been diffused you wouldn''t have that problem. While the arrangement of the food on the plate is attractive, the picture itself lacks interest, I know because I have been told this lots of times. The green touch is nice but doesn''t add enough pizzaz. Don''t be afraid to get up close and let some of the image get oof. Food is one of the hardest things to photograph and this is a good attempt.', '2004-02-18 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586652, 60223, 11800, '<td valign="top">Black on black. good job.</td>', 'Black on black. good job.', '2004-02-18 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(586701, 60492, 11800, '<td valign="top">Great control of the important things, especially the light. Interesting placement of the lights. This is evidently a good photo, so I feel odd saying this, but did you try a square crop? It might have contrasted nicely with the roundness of the pot.</td>', 'Great control of the important things, especially the light. Interesting placement of the lights. This is evidently a good photo, so I feel odd saying this, but did you try a square crop? It might have contrasted nicely with the roundness of the pot.', '2004-02-18 20:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(586716, 60292, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wonderful simplicity and complexity. It would be hard to say what this was without the title. Good choice to show the light source within the composition. Everything is perfect, imo. It was a pleasure to look at this.</td>', 'Wonderful simplicity and complexity. It would be hard to say what this was without the title. Good choice to show the light source within the composition. Everything is perfect, imo. It was a pleasure to look at this.', '2004-02-18 20:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(586738, 60668, 11800, '<td valign="top">My eye started in the upper right down to the center left and then to the lower right. Exactly what should happen with a well composed photo. One thing that I would like to suggest would be to have the right side a little more in focus?</td>', 'My eye started in the upper right down to the center left and then to the lower right. Exactly what should happen with a well composed photo. One thing that I would like to suggest would be to have the right side a little more in focus?', '2004-02-18 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(586847, 60541, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a coincidence...it came up black.  :  )<br/>Fantastic shot...my favorite...good luck  10</td>', 'What a coincidence...it came up black.  :  )Fantastic shot...my favorite...good luck  10', '2004-02-18 21:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(586853, 60201, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its a great shot.  Very sweet.  Fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Its a great shot.  Very sweet.  Fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-18 21:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586939, 60196, 92, '<td valign="top">So far this is my only 10 and honestly my only vote over a 6. This has everything going for it. Great lighting and composition, perfect color and contrast, interesting subject mixed with leading lines. This all works together to make this an amazing photo ! = 10</td>', 'So far this is my only 10 and honestly my only vote over a 6. This has everything going for it. Great lighting and composition, perfect color and contrast, interesting subject mixed with leading lines. This all works together to make this an amazing photo ! = 10', '2004-02-18 22:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(586986, 60161, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the angle with the light captures this perfectly good use of light</td>', 'Great shot, the angle with the light captures this perfectly good use of light', '2004-02-18 22:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586989, 60182, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great, this is a wonderful approach to the black subject, 10</td>', 'Great, this is a wonderful approach to the black subject, 10', '2004-02-18 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(587012, 60685, 10848, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2004-02-18 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587024, 60663, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the yellow against the black</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the yellow against the black', '2004-02-18 23:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587033, 60394, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect.  Good job</td>', 'Nice lighting effect.  Good job', '2004-02-18 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587038, 60475, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes, but I wish I could see a little more detail in the cat.  Dark pets are sooo hard to photograph.  I have a chocolate lab, that is a tough one too.</td>', 'Nice eyes, but I wish I could see a little more detail in the cat.  Dark pets are sooo hard to photograph.  I have a chocolate lab, that is a tough one too.', '2004-02-18 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
