(587755, 60689, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - great composition - very nostalgic feel to it.  I like she somewhat monochrome feel this has except for the red lights and the blue reflection in the chrome.  7</td>', 'Beautiful image - great composition - very nostalgic feel to it.  I like she somewhat monochrome feel this has except for the red lights and the blue reflection in the chrome.  7', '2004-02-19 09:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587758, 60653, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - very cool abstract image.  I can''t decide for the life of me what it is, but I know I like it.  Fits well with the challenge and the dynamic lines add a level of visual interest, besides all those blue tones.  Lovely.  8</td>', 'Wow - very cool abstract image.  I can''t decide for the life of me what it is, but I know I like it.  Fits well with the challenge and the dynamic lines add a level of visual interest, besides all those blue tones.  Lovely.  8', '2004-02-19 09:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(587781, 60645, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like the full-frame composition, and you''ve definitely met the challenge, but I''m not sure I like the solarized coloration.  I''ll still give it a 6 for strong composition and interesting details, though.</td>', 'I really like the full-frame composition, and you''ve definitely met the challenge, but I''m not sure I like the solarized coloration.  I''ll still give it a 6 for strong composition and interesting details, though.', '2004-02-19 09:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587812, 60244, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and very nice blue color in the background.  There''s a halo around the statue that is distracting, but otherwise a nice image.</td>', 'Nice compostion and very nice blue color in the background.  There''s a halo around the statue that is distracting, but otherwise a nice image.', '2004-02-19 10:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(587829, 60668, 5391, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful image.  Fits the challenge well, absolutely gorgeous tonal range, and those verticals all pressed together so tightly work so well with the overall dynamic composition.  Congratulations on a wonderful shot.  10</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful image.  Fits the challenge well, absolutely gorgeous tonal range, and those verticals all pressed together so tightly work so well with the overall dynamic composition.  Congratulations on a wonderful shot.  10', '2004-02-19 10:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587843, 60233, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like the moment of capture - you''ve definitely got an image packed with emotional content.  I also really like the composition of the two figures against the background, their feet placed almost at the bottom of the image.  I''m not sure I like the high contrast or extreme color saturation.  I''ll have to come back and look at it a few more times and see if it grows on me.  On one hand, it makes the subjects have an almost charicature-like feeling to them, which enhances the emotion of the shot.  On the other hand, I''d love to see more texture in those blacks and especially in the girl''s skin.  A 7 for now...</td>', 'I really like the moment of capture - you''ve definitely got an image packed with emotional content.  I also really like the composition of the two figures against the background, their feet placed almost at the bottom of the image.  I''m not sure I like the high contrast or extreme color saturation.  I''ll have to come back and look at it a few more times and see if it grows on me.  On one hand, it makes the subjects have an almost charicature-like feeling to them, which enhances the emotion of the shot.  On the other hand, I''d love to see more texture in those blacks and especially in the girl''s skin.  A 7 for now...', '2004-02-19 10:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587862, 60660, 5391, '<td valign="top">Creative use of the reflection!  Nice tonal range, tells a story, fits well with the challenge, very good overall shot.  8</td>', 'Creative use of the reflection!  Nice tonal range, tells a story, fits well with the challenge, very good overall shot.  8', '2004-02-19 10:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587873, 60227, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the sharpness and the composition.  The more I look at it, the more I''m distracted by what appears to be a ball hovering in mid-air by what should be the shooter''s right hand.  ??  If you re-shot it without that, it would be an easy 10.  With it, it''s a 7 - I can''t quit looking at that circle, and the fact that the highlights are blown out on it are even more distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the sharpness and the composition.  The more I look at it, the more I''m distracted by what appears to be a ball hovering in mid-air by what should be the shooter''s right hand.  ??  If you re-shot it without that, it would be an easy 10.  With it, it''s a 7 - I can''t quit looking at that circle, and the fact that the highlights are blown out on it are even more distracting.', '2004-02-19 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587881, 60196, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice product shot.  Good job with the reflective surface and a nice composition.  Very nice, clean image that fits the challenge well.  7</td>', 'Very nice product shot.  Good job with the reflective surface and a nice composition.  Very nice, clean image that fits the challenge well.  7', '2004-02-19 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587887, 60481, 5391, '<td valign="top">An overall good idea, but I''m distracted by the fact that the little letters on the ace are upside down.  I like the overall composition though, and it fits the challenge in a creative manner.</td>', 'An overall good idea, but I''m distracted by the fact that the little letters on the ace are upside down.  I like the overall composition though, and it fits the challenge in a creative manner.', '2004-02-19 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587903, 60591, 5391, '<td valign="top">Okay...  I''m having trouble coming up with anything other than...  WOW.  The detail in the trees, the silhouette of the hill, and the beautiful bright blue colors of... Orion?  (I''m bad with constellations...) This is an absolute gorgeous shot.  10</td>', 'Okay...  I''m having trouble coming up with anything other than...  WOW.  The detail in the trees, the silhouette of the hill, and the beautiful bright blue colors of... Orion?  (I''m bad with constellations...) This is an absolute gorgeous shot.  10', '2004-02-19 10:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(588351, 60164, 11895, '<td valign="top">grainy</td>', 'grainy', '2004-02-19 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(588387, 60236, 7438, '<td valign="top">It''s not the same without the red detailing :)</td>', 'It''s not the same without the red detailing :)', '2004-02-19 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(588407, 60576, 11895, '<td valign="top">vg idea but needs more DoF so the rose shows up better</td>', 'vg idea but needs more DoF so the rose shows up better', '2004-02-19 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(588436, 60233, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think you brightened this too much, I would have liked to see the texture of the background in more than just the girls'' shadows</td>', 'I think you brightened this too much, I would have liked to see the texture of the background in more than just the girls'' shadows', '2004-02-19 13:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(588437, 60463, 11895, '<td valign="top">would have scored higher with me if it were color</td>', 'would have scored higher with me if it were color', '2004-02-19 13:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(588472, 60663, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is neat!</td>', 'This is neat!', '2004-02-19 14:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(588491, 60159, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting. I like how everything melds together. Strong expression on the subject. I wonder what a tad more lighting would be like on a portion of the face/eyes, and shoulder. I wonder if it would bump up the drama a bit more.</td>', 'interesting. I like how everything melds together. Strong expression on the subject. I wonder what a tad more lighting would be like on a portion of the face/eyes, and shoulder. I wonder if it would bump up the drama a bit more.', '2004-02-19 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(588564, 60222, 806, '<td valign="top">very very pretty! I think the space on the left is not necessary... doesn''t entirely detract, yet doesn''t add either. I wonder what a closer crop would yield.</td>', 'very very pretty! I think the space on the left is not necessary... doesn''t entirely detract, yet doesn''t add either. I wonder what a closer crop would yield.', '2004-02-19 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(588566, 60469, 806, '<td valign="top">this is emotional even without the title. nice job on the lighting and portrayal.</td>', 'this is emotional even without the title. nice job on the lighting and portrayal.', '2004-02-19 15:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(588567, 60541, 11895, '<td valign="top">very creative idea, maybe color would have looked better</td>', 'very creative idea, maybe color would have looked better', '2004-02-19 15:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(588596, 60672, 806, '<td valign="top">very very pretty...</td>', 'very very pretty...', '2004-02-19 15:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(588601, 60685, 17055, '<td valign="top">great shot! love the contrast that compliments</td>', 'great shot! love the contrast that compliments', '2004-02-19 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(588602, 60660, 17055, '<td valign="top">love what you captured within the lens of the sunglasses nice!</td>', 'love what you captured within the lens of the sunglasses nice!', '2004-02-19 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(588653, 60242, 12131, '<td valign="top">Soft, calm, solid contrast that doesn''t stand out more than the other.  I like this shot.</td>', 'Soft, calm, solid contrast that doesn''t stand out more than the other.  I like this shot.', '2004-02-19 15:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(588658, 60224, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the material though I must say that in the thumbnail, it looked like a nose.  Still smooth lines and shades.</td>', 'I like the material though I must say that in the thumbnail, it looked like a nose.  Still smooth lines and shades.', '2004-02-19 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(588933, 60497, 11895, '<td valign="top">too dark, there is no detail in the truck body from bumper to windshield</td>', 'too dark, there is no detail in the truck body from bumper to windshield', '2004-02-19 17:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(589023, 60698, 11895, '<td valign="top">way too dark</td>', 'way too dark', '2004-02-19 18:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(589024, 60577, 17503, '<td valign="top">kinda like my pics, I love it!</td>', 'kinda like my pics, I love it!', '2004-02-19 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(589033, 60416, 17503, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-02-19 18:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(589035, 60660, 17503, '<td valign="top">love the leather! nice collage of elements.</td>', 'love the leather! nice collage of elements.', '2004-02-19 18:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(589036, 60223, 17503, '<td valign="top">good interpretation....</td>', 'good interpretation....', '2004-02-19 18:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(589089, 60525, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find this shot a bit overcrowded.</td>', 'I find this shot a bit overcrowded.', '2004-02-19 19:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(589116, 60469, 14401, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge!  Excellent job - 10</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge!  Excellent job - 10', '2004-02-19 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(589119, 60591, 14401, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of Orion''s Belt!</td>', 'Nice capture of Orion''s Belt!', '2004-02-19 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(589125, 60672, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in this.  Not quite black overall, but I like it very much and it works for me.</td>', 'Very nice colors in this.  Not quite black overall, but I like it very much and it works for me.', '2004-02-19 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(589128, 60201, 14401, '<td valign="top">A little too soft of focus.</td>', 'A little too soft of focus.', '2004-02-19 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(589130, 60696, 14401, '<td valign="top">Colors here are just not appetizing.  Would try to tone down the greenish look of the nuts and get rid of the pink background.</td>', 'Colors here are just not appetizing.  Would try to tone down the greenish look of the nuts and get rid of the pink background.', '2004-02-19 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(589136, 60278, 14401, '<td valign="top">There are just some subjects that don''t seem appealing to me  - although I guess it fits the challenge theme.  Rugby shirt?</td>', 'There are just some subjects that don''t seem appealing to me  - although I guess it fits the challenge theme.  Rugby shirt?', '2004-02-19 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(589140, 60650, 14401, '<td valign="top">This needed some other element to add interest - not sure what.</td>', 'This needed some other element to add interest - not sure what.', '2004-02-19 20:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(589161, 60200, 2158, '<td valign="top">Very sinister looking portrait.  Well done.</td>', 'Very sinister looking portrait.  Well done.', '2004-02-19 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(589184, 60222, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-02-19 20:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(589231, 60222, 14012, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Is that a Hosta leaf?</td>', 'Interesting. Is that a Hosta leaf?', '2004-02-19 20:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(589248, 60227, 14012, '<td valign="top">Appears to me,  that would be considered an illegal jump shot. Need to come down on the cue, rather than scooping it.  :-)<br/> <br/>About the photo: Great shot. I like the angle, lighting, DOF, reflection on the 8 ball...well, actually everything about it. This will probably be in the top 3 this week.</td>', 'Appears to me,  that would be considered an illegal jump shot. Need to come down on the cue, rather than scooping it.  :-) About the photo: Great shot. I like the angle, lighting, DOF, reflection on the 8 ball...well, actually everything about it. This will probably be in the top 3 this week.', '2004-02-19 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(589264, 60548, 14012, '<td valign="top">I wish I could find a cemetary like this. Very nice, although, I think it would have looked neat tilted just a bit more. Also, the part of the cross on the left side of the frame is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I wish I could find a cemetary like this. Very nice, although, I think it would have looked neat tilted just a bit more. Also, the part of the cross on the left side of the frame is a bit distracting.', '2004-02-19 21:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(589293, 60292, 14012, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the straight down angle</td>', 'Not sure I like the straight down angle', '2004-02-19 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(589298, 60442, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometric.</td>', 'Interesting geometric.', '2004-02-19 21:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(589306, 60577, 3306, '<td valign="top">Magnificent eyes.</td>', 'Magnificent eyes.', '2004-02-19 21:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(589309, 60097, 14012, '<td valign="top">seems to have a lot of noise. Looks out of focus too.</td>', 'seems to have a lot of noise. Looks out of focus too.', '2004-02-19 21:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(589345, 60201, 3306, '<td valign="top">Could have been good but out of focus.</td>', 'Could have been good but out of focus.', '2004-02-19 21:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(589358, 60541, 3306, '<td valign="top">nicely done. Quite different and original.</td>', 'nicely done. Quite different and original.', '2004-02-19 21:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(589360, 60227, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. Well focused.</td>', 'Good action shot. Well focused.', '2004-02-19 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(589369, 60603, 3306, '<td valign="top">Striking.</td>', 'Striking.', '2004-02-19 21:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(589370, 60697, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done. One of the top 5 in this challenge and I don''t even have a canon!!</td>', 'Well done. One of the top 5 in this challenge and I don''t even have a canon!!', '2004-02-19 21:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589382, 60603, 14012, '<td valign="top">You''re probably getting slammed for the post-processing, but I really like it.</td>', 'You''re probably getting slammed for the post-processing, but I really like it.', '2004-02-19 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(589386, 60645, 11800, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. Cutting off all the curves reduces the object to a pleasing abstract where one is forced to look at the darkness within the cup. Not such a big fan of the overworked colors. I would like to see an unaltered version after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Love the composition. Cutting off all the curves reduces the object to a pleasing abstract where one is forced to look at the darkness within the cup. Not such a big fan of the overworked colors. I would like to see an unaltered version after the challenge is over.', '2004-02-19 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(589394, 60511, 14012, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but nothing looks black.</td>', 'Sorry, but nothing looks black.', '2004-02-19 22:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(589398, 60577, 14012, '<td valign="top">very nice selective desaturation. nice sharp focus on the eyes as well</td>', 'very nice selective desaturation. nice sharp focus on the eyes as well', '2004-02-19 22:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(589401, 60164, 14012, '<td valign="top">Seems to have quite a bit of noise. Decent macro though</td>', 'Seems to have quite a bit of noise. Decent macro though', '2004-02-19 22:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(589420, 60269, 11800, '<td valign="top">I want to like this because I think the technical side of things are well done. But when I look at it, I get confused. I hate to say that. The amount of detail says I should be able to identify the object, but I can''t. It might be improved if the table wasn''t reflected in the chrome parts, that seems to be what''s confusing me.</td>', 'I want to like this because I think the technical side of things are well done. But when I look at it, I get confused. I hate to say that. The amount of detail says I should be able to identify the object, but I can''t. It might be improved if the table wasn''t reflected in the chrome parts, that seems to be what''s confusing me.', '2004-02-19 22:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(589444, 60186, 10402, '<td valign="top">The flowers add a splash of color that makes the black seem even blacker.</td>', 'The flowers add a splash of color that makes the black seem even blacker.', '2004-02-19 22:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(589448, 60657, 11800, '<td valign="top">Now I know what it feels like when people look at my abstracts. I like the lower part of the picture but there is something about the upper right that doesn''t feel right. I think it''s the red-pink part and the green highlight which I would like to extend all the way across the corner. The texture is great.<br/> It''s a keyboard? Can tell more from the thumbnail than from the actual picture. Did you use a filter to get the effect? I like it.</td>', 'Now I know what it feels like when people look at my abstracts. I like the lower part of the picture but there is something about the upper right that doesn''t feel right. I think it''s the red-pink part and the green highlight which I would like to extend all the way across the corner. The texture is great. It''s a keyboard? Can tell more from the thumbnail than from the actual picture. Did you use a filter to get the effect? I like it.', '2004-02-19 22:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589456, 60390, 10402, '<td valign="top">Framing the coal with the blackened hand makes this image really striking. It was one of the first I saw, and has remained my favorite as I voted on the rest.</td>', 'Framing the coal with the blackened hand makes this image really striking. It was one of the first I saw, and has remained my favorite as I voted on the rest.', '2004-02-19 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(589490, 60187, 10402, '<td valign="top">This image captures the form and texture very nicely, but the bright glare is distracting.</td>', 'This image captures the form and texture very nicely, but the bright glare is distracting.', '2004-02-19 22:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(589506, 60696, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but blurry. The purple steals the center of focus.</td>', 'Great subject, but blurry. The purple steals the center of focus.', '2004-02-19 23:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(589536, 60500, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the black center seems out of place compared to the outside background.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the black center seems out of place compared to the outside background.', '2004-02-19 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(589543, 60463, 10402, '<td valign="top">I trust the title, but it''s hard to tell that the helmet is black in this image. I think color would have worked better.</td>', 'I trust the title, but it''s hard to tell that the helmet is black in this image. I think color would have worked better.', '2004-02-19 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(589553, 60653, 10402, '<td valign="top">An interesting image that gets more interesting as I look at it.</td>', 'An interesting image that gets more interesting as I look at it.', '2004-02-19 23:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589556, 60128, 10402, '<td valign="top">The colored background helps emphasize the black in the mittens. I think it could use a little sharpening.</td>', 'The colored background helps emphasize the black in the mittens. I think it could use a little sharpening.', '2004-02-19 23:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(589565, 60469, 10402, '<td valign="top">Just enough color to make the black believable. Great composition.</td>', 'Just enough color to make the black believable. Great composition.', '2004-02-19 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(589578, 60660, 10402, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of the texture of the leather and form of the gloves, with some nice contrasting elements and a surprise.</td>', 'Perfect capture of the texture of the leather and form of the gloves, with some nice contrasting elements and a surprise.', '2004-02-19 23:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(589585, 60224, 10402, '<td valign="top">Elegant shape with good sharpness and DOF.</td>', 'Elegant shape with good sharpness and DOF.', '2004-02-19 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589595, 60688, 10402, '<td valign="top">The black background makes this image very striking. But the center of interest is on the flowers, not the black.</td>', 'The black background makes this image very striking. But the center of interest is on the flowers, not the black.', '2004-02-19 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(589607, 60576, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think this wouild have worked better if the music and rose were at the bottom, with the keys extending to the top of the image.</td>', 'I think this wouild have worked better if the music and rose were at the bottom, with the keys extending to the top of the image.', '2004-02-19 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(589653, 60541, 4258, '<td valign="top">Wish it was a sharper image</td>', 'Wish it was a sharper image', '2004-02-20 00:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(589751, 60660, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like it very much, is one of my three favorits. Took me a while to see the "baby" but then made LOL. Great texture and light. I would not have put the gloves ino the sleeves though, looks a bit unnatural. Good luck to you!</td>', 'Like it very much, is one of my three favorits. Took me a while to see the "baby" but then made LOL. Great texture and light. I would not have put the gloves ino the sleeves though, looks a bit unnatural. Good luck to you!', '2004-02-20 02:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(589755, 60233, 5158, '<td valign="top">Strong entry lifving from its strong contrast and the great white of the wall. The pose of the two is interesting while alos a bit disturbing: I would like to know to what they are looking and she is laughing. Maybe a different title would have solved this. Good luck.</td>', 'Strong entry lifving from its strong contrast and the great white of the wall. The pose of the two is interesting while alos a bit disturbing: I would like to know to what they are looking and she is laughing. Maybe a different title would have solved this. Good luck.', '2004-02-20 02:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(589758, 60672, 5158, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I do not see the conection to the challenge topic nor do I see the title work well. The image is dominated by the color blue of the ice and sky.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I do not see the conection to the challenge topic nor do I see the title work well. The image is dominated by the color blue of the ice and sky.', '2004-02-20 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(589833, 60677, 10084, '<td valign="top">Simple subject. Very good lighting gives a beautiful shadow to the indention of the 5 and really makes it pop out of the shot. Great texture captured on the weight. I like that you were decided to include a portion of the roundness of the weight. I think this shot would''ve done very well in the texture challenge. "10"</td>', 'Simple subject. Very good lighting gives a beautiful shadow to the indention of the 5 and really makes it pop out of the shot. Great texture captured on the weight. I like that you were decided to include a portion of the roundness of the weight. I think this shot would''ve done very well in the texture challenge. "10"', '2004-02-20 04:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(589915, 60492, 10084, '<td valign="top">The hard lighting really emphasizes the beautiful curves in the teapot. The lighting of the subject from underneath really gives a dramatic feeling to the composition. The reflections of the spout and the handle makes you feel the smooth surface of the teapot. "10"</td>', 'The hard lighting really emphasizes the beautiful curves in the teapot. The lighting of the subject from underneath really gives a dramatic feeling to the composition. The reflections of the spout and the handle makes you feel the smooth surface of the teapot. "10"', '2004-02-20 06:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(589927, 60577, 10084, '<td valign="top">The fans with it''s diagonal placement help to frame the face and puts focus on the eyes. The desaturated image except for the beautiful blue hue in the eyes really makes this interesting. The depth of field and focus on the eyes also helps. The only change I would make here is to use a fan without the flower pattern. it kinds of takes a little away from the eyes and a tiny bit distracting. "9"</td>', 'The fans with it''s diagonal placement help to frame the face and puts focus on the eyes. The desaturated image except for the beautiful blue hue in the eyes really makes this interesting. The depth of field and focus on the eyes also helps. The only change I would make here is to use a fan without the flower pattern. it kinds of takes a little away from the eyes and a tiny bit distracting. "9"', '2004-02-20 06:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590799, 60475, 16820, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Picture</td>', 'Very Nice Picture', '2004-02-20 14:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(590802, 60606, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice composition. My only comment is that the contrast could have been a little better, it tends to get too greyish for my taste now.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice composition. My only comment is that the contrast could have been a little better, it tends to get too greyish for my taste now.', '2004-02-20 14:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590859, 60289, 11800, '<td valign="top">More than likely there is a story behind this! To me it looks displaced from the holloween challenge. Sorry. <br/>As far as the exposure goes, you got a lot of details in, which is good and the focus is right on. IMO, there is a bit too much negative space above the subject.</td>', 'More than likely there is a story behind this! To me it looks displaced from the holloween challenge. Sorry. As far as the exposure goes, you got a lot of details in, which is good and the focus is right on. IMO, there is a bit too much negative space above the subject.', '2004-02-20 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590870, 60698, 11800, '<td valign="top">The light on top and outlining the faceplate adds a nice touch to the photo altough I would have liked more light all the way around the faceplate. It looks like the texture of leather in the background, but my monitor isn''t able to bring it out very well. If it is, I compliment you on the perfect choice of background. I had scored this 4 but because of your background, I''ll bump up your score. If you edit on a mac, you might want to increase your gamma setting. If you don''t, I apologize.</td>', 'The light on top and outlining the faceplate adds a nice touch to the photo altough I would have liked more light all the way around the faceplate. It looks like the texture of leather in the background, but my monitor isn''t able to bring it out very well. If it is, I compliment you on the perfect choice of background. I had scored this 4 but because of your background, I''ll bump up your score. If you edit on a mac, you might want to increase your gamma setting. If you don''t, I apologize.', '2004-02-20 15:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590880, 60153, 11800, '<td valign="top">I look at this and think of all kinds of possibilities. Not that you didn''t do a good job. All of the parts are so simple and interesting. Two black rectangles and two circles. I would love to see some more shots if you experiment with the composition and lighting.</td>', 'I look at this and think of all kinds of possibilities. Not that you didn''t do a good job. All of the parts are so simple and interesting. Two black rectangles and two circles. I would love to see some more shots if you experiment with the composition and lighting.', '2004-02-20 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590994, 60294, 17583, '<td valign="top">nice texture and creative idea.</td>', 'nice texture and creative idea.', '2004-02-20 17:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590996, 60463, 17583, '<td valign="top">beautiful reflection!</td>', 'beautiful reflection!', '2004-02-20 17:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(591000, 60184, 17583, '<td valign="top">Great thought. There''s no darkness w/o brightness in the world.</td>', 'Great thought. There''s no darkness w/o brightness in the world.', '2004-02-20 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(591008, 60465, 17583, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition.</td>', 'wonderful composition.', '2004-02-20 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(591014, 60543, 17583, '<td valign="top">Look at her eyes...<br/>I''m pretty much speechless, other than to say "excellent"!!</td>', 'Look at her eyes...I''m pretty much speechless, other than to say "excellent"!!', '2004-02-20 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(591050, 60163, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, however, the subject is somewhat uninteresting.  Nice detail and lighting.</td>', 'Great photograph, however, the subject is somewhat uninteresting.  Nice detail and lighting.', '2004-02-20 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591052, 60178, 6073, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Cool lighting and well compose.  Nice work</td>', 'I like this.  Cool lighting and well compose.  Nice work', '2004-02-20 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(591054, 60416, 6073, '<td valign="top">The bottom and top right of the photo are distracting.  What happened?  Maybe a closer crop?</td>', 'The bottom and top right of the photo are distracting.  What happened?  Maybe a closer crop?', '2004-02-20 18:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591058, 60660, 6073, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I was thinking an 8.  The cropping at the top was a lil tight.  Seems like you are cutting off some of the sleave cuff.  Also the lighting seemed like it could have been more dramatic.  However, looking at the reflection in the glasses.  10!   Great idea and execution.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'At first glance, I was thinking an 8.  The cropping at the top was a lil tight.  Seems like you are cutting off some of the sleave cuff.  Also the lighting seemed like it could have been more dramatic.  However, looking at the reflection in the glasses.  10!   Great idea and execution.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-02-20 18:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591069, 60159, 9411, '<td valign="top">I think this is a stunning and moving portrait. The one thing I find could be improved, and it''s only my opinion, is that the crop could have been brought up, not so much of his chest, and shown a bit more of his head.,,,<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'I think this is a stunning and moving portrait. The one thing I find could be improved, and it''s only my opinion, is that the crop could have been brought up, not so much of his chest, and shown a bit more of his head.,,, 10', '2004-02-20 18:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591070, 60391, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very moving portrait. fantastic work.  10</td>', 'Very moving portrait. fantastic work.  10', '2004-02-20 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591071, 60202, 9411, '<td valign="top">very nicely done, just enough information to know what your looking at, and just enough mystery to truly be magic.  10</td>', 'very nicely done, just enough information to know what your looking at, and just enough mystery to truly be magic.  10', '2004-02-20 18:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(591073, 60583, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Excellent shot using a strong back light to get your theme across. 10</td>', 'Very nicely done. Excellent shot using a strong back light to get your theme across. 10', '2004-02-20 18:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(591076, 60222, 9411, '<td valign="top">There are a couple of issues with this image. One the background is not even, there is a grey area upper left and two, this is very much looking like an image that was desaturated. I think these flower are bright red. THe center stamen has lost definition to what I would assume was the post processing.  5</td>', 'There are a couple of issues with this image. One the background is not even, there is a grey area upper left and two, this is very much looking like an image that was desaturated. I think these flower are bright red. THe center stamen has lost definition to what I would assume was the post processing.  5', '2004-02-20 18:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(591081, 60689, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is nice shot, but the talillights are really the stars here. Black is taking a secondary roll, imo.  5</td>', 'This is nice shot, but the talillights are really the stars here. Black is taking a secondary roll, imo.  5', '2004-02-20 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591090, 60696, 9411, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t leave comments where I have a hard time saying something good about a shot. I''m sorry but this is a very unappealing presentation. The colour of the chocolate is so unnatural and it is quite obvious that the shot was manipulated to get it that colour. that centre almond has a green tinge around it.  If I am wrong I apologize.  4</td>', 'I usually don''t leave comments where I have a hard time saying something good about a shot. I''m sorry but this is a very unappealing presentation. The colour of the chocolate is so unnatural and it is quite obvious that the shot was manipulated to get it that colour. that centre almond has a green tinge around it.  If I am wrong I apologize.  4', '2004-02-20 18:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(591137, 60568, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and toning. The bit of green in the eye is so subtle that it works. :)<br/>Perhaps the light is a bit harsh, perhaps soften it a bit in the next attempt (or perhaps do a partial USM by history brushing it there where you need it most).<br/>8</td>', 'Nice composition and toning. The bit of green in the eye is so subtle that it works. :)Perhaps the light is a bit harsh, perhaps soften it a bit in the next attempt (or perhaps do a partial USM by history brushing it there where you need it most).8', '2004-02-20 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591139, 60636, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Likte the toning, the composoition and the angle of the lines.</td>', 'Nice work. Likte the toning, the composoition and the angle of the lines.', '2004-02-20 18:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(591142, 60155, 14837, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I like this one!</td>', 'Cute idea.  I like this one!', '2004-02-20 18:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(591143, 60484, 3032, '<td valign="top">From a distance it is almost like a cat with eyes and whiskers. :)<br/>I am allergic to cats, but this is a nice photograph. ;)<br/>Perhaps some softer light would work a bit better.</td>', 'From a distance it is almost like a cat with eyes and whiskers. :)I am allergic to cats, but this is a nice photograph. ;)Perhaps some softer light would work a bit better.', '2004-02-20 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(591144, 60155, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the composition, the lighting and the overal quality of the photo.<br/>8</td>', 'I like the idea, the composition, the lighting and the overal quality of the photo.8', '2004-02-20 18:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(591146, 60178, 3032, '<td valign="top">Love it how the light works with the curves in the chocolate and the negative space seems to work very good as well. Well done.</td>', 'Love it how the light works with the curves in the chocolate and the negative space seems to work very good as well. Well done.', '2004-02-20 18:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(591173, 60645, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think the noice works really well here.  Great photo.  Not sure how it will do here, since its a bit different, but I sure like it.</td>', 'I think the noice works really well here.  Great photo.  Not sure how it will do here, since its a bit different, but I sure like it.', '2004-02-20 19:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(591330, 60698, 15330, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the bottom and rear of the helmet might be better. you should''ve also moved the helmet a little farther from the background, I can see the black background on the top of the frame. This is a good idea, having the helmet coming out of the darkness, but it could be better.</td>', 'A little more light on the bottom and rear of the helmet might be better. you should''ve also moved the helmet a little farther from the background, I can see the black background on the top of the frame. This is a good idea, having the helmet coming out of the darkness, but it could be better.', '2004-02-20 21:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591334, 60663, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, the contrast between yellow and black is always great. You will probobly get voted down because the description of the challenge said a black object, this is a yellow object with a black background. On a different challenge this would''ve been a top 10.</td>', 'I like the photo, the contrast between yellow and black is always great. You will probobly get voted down because the description of the challenge said a black object, this is a yellow object with a black background. On a different challenge this would''ve been a top 10.', '2004-02-20 21:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591341, 60668, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the black tones in the photo. The composition/ point of view could be better. There is too much in the photo, I don''t know what to focus on so  my eyes keep jumping around.</td>', 'I like the black tones in the photo. The composition/ point of view could be better. There is too much in the photo, I don''t know what to focus on so  my eyes keep jumping around.', '2004-02-20 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591343, 60163, 15330, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, the silver button is placed well in the frame, and draws my attention, although the lighting is a little too bright there. I would''ve liked this better with a white background to contrast the black, and go with the white button. Or you could have a black bacground with no texture.</td>', 'The composition is good, the silver button is placed well in the frame, and draws my attention, although the lighting is a little too bright there. I would''ve liked this better with a white background to contrast the black, and go with the white button. Or you could have a black bacground with no texture.', '2004-02-20 21:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(591345, 60688, 15330, '<td valign="top">If I remember correctly the description for the challenge said a black object. Other than that I like the contrast between yellow, white, and black, makes the flowers stand out. You could have positioned them better, being in the middle of the frame doesn''t help much. The lighting on that bottom flower is a little too dark, some light would help it come out more, unless you wanted it to be dark.</td>', 'If I remember correctly the description for the challenge said a black object. Other than that I like the contrast between yellow, white, and black, makes the flowers stand out. You could have positioned them better, being in the middle of the frame doesn''t help much. The lighting on that bottom flower is a little too dark, some light would help it come out more, unless you wanted it to be dark.', '2004-02-20 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(591356, 60202, 12207, '<td valign="top">cool, but would be nice to see more eye</td>', 'cool, but would be nice to see more eye', '2004-02-20 21:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591394, 60697, 10818, '<td valign="top">One day...maybe.  :  )  Nice photo.</td>', 'One day...maybe.  :  )  Nice photo.', '2004-02-20 22:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(591396, 60236, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lens. I''d like to see all of it sharp, especially since the bright white background seems to bleed into the lens where it''s unsharp. Smaller stop, more DOF, would cure this.</td>', 'Nice lens. I''d like to see all of it sharp, especially since the bright white background seems to bleed into the lens where it''s unsharp. Smaller stop, more DOF, would cure this.', '2004-02-20 22:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591398, 60506, 12733, '<td valign="top">The challenge is black, but I think you''ve carried it too far. It''s difficult to see enough of the main subject to tell what it is.</td>', 'The challenge is black, but I think you''ve carried it too far. It''s difficult to see enough of the main subject to tell what it is.', '2004-02-20 22:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(591399, 60659, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effects - you could read almost anything into that center section.</td>', 'Very interesting effects - you could read almost anything into that center section.', '2004-02-20 22:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(591401, 60586, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures - this would have been really great in that challenge. I like the shapes and the play of light over the forms, but I have to say some color is creeping in on the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting textures - this would have been really great in that challenge. I like the shapes and the play of light over the forms, but I have to say some color is creeping in on the foreground.', '2004-02-20 22:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591404, 60606, 12733, '<td valign="top">There''s something there, and I can almost make it out - very interesting and a little frustrating. A picture that will keep you looking.</td>', 'There''s something there, and I can almost make it out - very interesting and a little frustrating. A picture that will keep you looking.', '2004-02-20 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591407, 60238, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very pretty bird, and the rocks are nicely colored. I like the capture of the swirling water.</td>', 'A very pretty bird, and the rocks are nicely colored. I like the capture of the swirling water.', '2004-02-20 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(591410, 60239, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of low-key lighting to show a subject as almost black on black. I can;t figure out what that subject is, though.</td>', 'Nice use of low-key lighting to show a subject as almost black on black. I can;t figure out what that subject is, though.', '2004-02-20 22:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591412, 60669, 12733, '<td valign="top">That red really stands out against the black, and even with the uniformity of colors, the red suggests the actual lines of the black lamp. Good idea, good capture.</td>', 'That red really stands out against the black, and even with the uniformity of colors, the red suggests the actual lines of the black lamp. Good idea, good capture.', '2004-02-20 22:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591413, 60318, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black against a color. The black seems blacker against the light blue and off-white.</td>', 'Nice use of black against a color. The black seems blacker against the light blue and off-white.', '2004-02-20 22:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(591417, 60515, 12733, '<td valign="top">Set against that blurred background, he seems to be flying right out of the picture.</td>', 'Set against that blurred background, he seems to be flying right out of the picture.', '2004-02-20 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(591418, 60201, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, cute dog - but black????</td>', 'Cute kid, cute dog - but black????', '2004-02-20 22:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(591420, 60579, 12733, '<td valign="top">Mysterious shadows and strange lights - a picture to puzzle over and keep looking. Nice shot.</td>', 'Mysterious shadows and strange lights - a picture to puzzle over and keep looking. Nice shot.', '2004-02-20 22:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(591423, 60689, 12733, '<td valign="top">Definitely an antique. Nice shot.</td>', 'Definitely an antique. Nice shot.', '2004-02-20 22:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591424, 60665, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very attractive serving, and the green sets it off nicely.</td>', 'A very attractive serving, and the green sets it off nicely.', '2004-02-20 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(591426, 60184, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious effect. Without the title I wouldn''t have been sure what was creating the flame. I like the bit of blue at the bottom of the flame - that often gets lost in a photo.</td>', 'Very mysterious effect. Without the title I wouldn''t have been sure what was creating the flame. I like the bit of blue at the bottom of the flame - that often gets lost in a photo.', '2004-02-20 22:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(591430, 60094, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an attractive shot, with the flower setting off the black hand. One caveat (not directly related to the picture): The use of rainforest wood for decorations and construction is one of the contributors to the loss of the forests.</td>', 'This is an attractive shot, with the flower setting off the black hand. One caveat (not directly related to the picture): The use of rainforest wood for decorations and construction is one of the contributors to the loss of the forests.', '2004-02-20 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(591434, 60568, 12733, '<td valign="top">Despite the title, there''s something menacing about this photo. Nice use of black and good contrast with the face.</td>', 'Despite the title, there''s something menacing about this photo. Nice use of black and good contrast with the face.', '2004-02-20 22:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(591438, 60475, 12733, '<td valign="top">Those eyes really grab you. I''d like to see more detail within the cat - other than the eyes she''s just a black blob - and the background doesn''t help.</td>', 'Those eyes really grab you. I''d like to see more detail within the cat - other than the eyes she''s just a black blob - and the background doesn''t help.', '2004-02-20 22:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
