(591447, 60483, 12733, '<td valign="top">Almost revealed, anyway. I don''t see enough to really make out what it is that''s being revealed.</td>', 'Almost revealed, anyway. I don''t see enough to really make out what it is that''s being revealed.', '2004-02-20 22:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
