(591827, 60200, 7889, '<td valign="top">Hi John, I am a little dissapointed this did not finish much higher, it deserves to imho. Its a wonderful photo and was one of 3 I gave my top vote to. Great work.</td>', 'Hi John, I am a little dissapointed this did not finish much higher, it deserves to imho. Its a wonderful photo and was one of 3 I gave my top vote to. Great work.', '2004-02-21 06:24:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(591834, 60112, 7889, '<td valign="top">Boy did I mess up with this one! I was just too lazy to change the border after I uploaded it! Doh! Never mind I have learnt my lesson, Thanks to all for your comments. Took the photo on the kitchen worktop and used flash to try and obliterate the pattern on the worktop but I still had some under the shadow of the boot. I have always wanted a pair of Cuban Heel boots and when I was in Madrid last year I finally got them!<br/></td>', 'Boy did I mess up with this one! I was just too lazy to change the border after I uploaded it! Doh! Never mind I have learnt my lesson, Thanks to all for your comments. Took the photo on the kitchen worktop and used flash to try and obliterate the pattern on the worktop but I still had some under the shadow of the boot. I have always wanted a pair of Cuban Heel boots and when I was in Madrid last year I finally got them!', '2004-02-21 06:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
