(592010, 60391, 14012, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>Hi Ellamay!<br/> <br/>400 shots...wow, you definately did have a very patient subject. <br/> <br/>You followed the rule of thirds nicely. The black on black composition is great and the subtle lighting is just enough to seperate the subject from the background on the right. They eyes really grab your attention when you first look at this. You have a nice sharp focus, allowing good detail on the eyes.<br/> <br/>Possible improvements:<br/>I think maybe just a little light from the top or top-right would have helped define the top of the head of your subject better. <br/> <br/>Overall a nice photo that is pleasing to look at.<br/> <br/>-Chris<br/></td>', '**Critique Club** Hi Ellamay! 400 shots...wow, you definately did have a very patient subject.  You followed the rule of thirds nicely. The black on black composition is great and the subtle lighting is just enough to seperate the subject from the background on the right. They eyes really grab your attention when you first look at this. You have a nice sharp focus, allowing good detail on the eyes. Possible improvements:I think maybe just a little light from the top or top-right would have helped define the top of the head of your subject better.  Overall a nice photo that is pleasing to look at. -Chris', '2004-02-21 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(592011, 60390, 8624, '<td valign="top">congrats on the ribbon Jorg! I love the details in this image, like the coal dust under the fingernails. Great use of negative space as well. Your work continues to be among my favorites!</td>', 'congrats on the ribbon Jorg! I love the details in this image, like the coal dust under the fingernails. Great use of negative space as well. Your work continues to be among my favorites!', '2004-02-21 09:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
