(593281, 60543, 4500, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JasonPR:</b></div><hr/><i> Now I realize that the subject wasn''t black and that''s what did it.   </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tarique:</b></div><hr/><i> However I did not vote on this image becuase for me it is not a picture with a black object as a subject.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, when I finnished my photo and uploaded it, I read forums about the topic and realized that my <b>subject</b> should be black, and that people will give low scores if it''s not. But I was pretty satisfied with the photo and I did not unsubmit it and was curious how the score will be even though the subject wasn''t black. So I was happy to stay over the 6 mark.<br/> <br/>Thanks...</td>', 'Originally posted by JasonPR: Now I realize that the subject wasn''t black and that''s what did it.     Originally posted by tarique: However I did not vote on this image becuase for me it is not a picture with a black object as a subject.  Yeah, when I finnished my photo and uploaded it, I read forums about the topic and realized that my subject should be black, and that people will give low scores if it''s not. But I was pretty satisfied with the photo and I did not unsubmit it and was curious how the score will be even though the subject wasn''t black. So I was happy to stay over the 6 mark. Thanks...', '2004-02-22 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
